{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37751","headline":"寄同年礼部赵郎中 · 郑谷","name":"寄同年礼部赵郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙步徐徐整羽衣，小仪澄澹转中仪。\n桦飘红烬趋朝路，兰纵清香宿省时。\n彩笔烟霞供不足，纶闱鸾凤讶来迟。\n自怜孤宦谁相念，祷祝空吟一首诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}